<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12147] Thin client: Partitions response doesn&apos;t contain caches for which affinity awareness is not applicable</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12147</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Partitions response never contains caches for which affinity awareness is not applicable (unlike specified by the protocol) even if information for these caches was explicitly requested.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;.NET thin client also fails while processing messages for caches without partitions information.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
