                            <comment id="16926691" author="alex_pl" created="Tue, 10 Sep 2019 14:30:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;, could you please review the patch?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is .NET thin client implementation changed.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Actually .NET thin client behavior left the same since the client doesn&apos;t request partitions for a new cache unless topology is changed.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16926854" author="ptupitsyn" created="Tue, 10 Sep 2019 19:32:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; Logic looks good to me, but tests need some improvements, please see comments on GitHub.&lt;br/&gt;
