                            <comment id="16927548" author="alex_pl" created="Wed, 11 Sep 2019 13:14:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=ptupitsyn&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;ptupitsyn&quot;&gt;ptupitsyn&lt;/a&gt;&#160;thanks for tips, I&apos;ve fixed the tests.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16928357" author="ptupitsyn" created="Thu, 12 Sep 2019 08:23:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; thanks, looks good to me now.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16929108" author="alex_pl" created="Fri, 13 Sep 2019 10:55:42 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;TC suite for C++ thin client passed without errors (as well as other thin clients).&lt;/p&gt;

